  "notes": "# OverCue 0.11.5\n\nFor CDJ-3000 firmware 3.22.\n\n- Gate Cue now remembers its last setting through shutdown and reboot.\n- Restores the Pioneer jog-display startup logo and the unloaded rekordbox logo in light mode.\n- Improves the MT indicator in light mode.\n- Shows the STEMS tab indicator whenever a stem is muted or set to partial volume.\n- Adds an S below the existing H to identify tracks with prepared stems in all Browse views, in both themes.\n- Fixes stem toggles and volume adjustments with Master Tempo off and Key Shift active.\n",
